{
  "id": "RAW_8db37681b4",
  "title": "AI 打假 2299 元防摔戒指，少交智商税还得靠 AI",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NjgzMzkwMQ==&mid=2653653112&idx=1&sn=f47d0b72a862942eccabeee579b44b82",
  "date": "2026-11-05 19:06:00",
  "author": "傅盛",
  "siteName": "傅盛",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>傅盛和龙虾三万</span> <span>2026-11-05 19:06</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_82092ea.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>忽悠，接着忽悠</p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">AI打假，这次盯上了一枚2299元的防摔戒指。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">商家号称戴上就能改善人体平衡，防止老人摔倒。现场演示得神乎其神：不戴戒指，一推就倒；戴上以后，怎么推都站得稳。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169429\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_68636fc.gif\"></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">结果AI一分析，所谓黑科技，竟然用中学物理就能看穿。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我们让它一边</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">分析商家宣称的科学原理，一边设计实验</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。最后发现，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">只要稍微</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">改变推人的方向</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">，就能演出差不多的效果。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"line-height: 1.6em;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">江湖骗术层出不穷，但现在有了AI，普通人也能少交点智商税了。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">AI打假：普通手表也能画地为牢？</span></span></h2>\n  <h1 data-pm-slice=\"2 2 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这东西叫“平衡随行智能指环”，</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">只有3.5克，售价2299元，号称</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom: 8px;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">用了什么复合微磁新材料，</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">戴上就能</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">改善人体平衡能力，老年人不容易摔倒，甚至还能改善睡眠。</span></span></h1>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1269\" data-imgfileid=\"506169428\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_0daf332.png\"></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我们</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">让AI帮忙设计了一组实验</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，思路很简单：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">商家说戴上戒指就能站得更稳，那如果</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">换成普通手表也能站稳，甚至摘掉手表以后照样站稳</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">，是不是说明所谓的防摔效果，根本</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">不需要靠戒指</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">就能实现？</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">于是找来两位同事，一个负责单腿站立，另一个负责压他的手臂，做了三次演示。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第一次，先不戴任何东西。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">同事单腿站好，伸出手臂，另一位同事往下一压，身体立刻歪了，差点没站住。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"1.778125\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169436\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_2a7d919.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第二次，换上一块普通手表。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">还是同样的姿势，还是压他的手臂。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">刚才一压就歪的人，这次明显稳多了。旁边的同事继续施压，他居然还能保持平衡。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"1.778125\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169459\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_9bf211d.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">难道这块手表里，还藏着什么我们自己都不知道的高科技？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第三次，干脆把手表也摘了。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">再试一次，结果更神奇，手腕上空空如也，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">人还是站得稳稳的，画地为牢了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"1.778125\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169437\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_f65d8ff.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这就有点搞笑了。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">戴着手表站得稳，摘了手表还是站得稳。难道黑科技还能隔空生效？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">其实，真正起作用的，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">跟手表一点关系没有。跟戒指也一点关系没有。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">防摔神器败给了初中物理</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">答案特别简单：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">改变了一下施力方向。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第一次，压手臂的时候，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">力稍微朝身体外侧偏一点，人就容易失去平衡</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第二次和第三次，我们把方向调整了一下，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">稍微朝身体内侧，也就是支撑脚的方向压，人就没那么容易倒了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">就这么一点角度的变化，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">旁边看的人很难发现，连被推的人自己都未必能感觉出来，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">结果却可能完全不同。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.453781512605042\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1428\" style=\"width: 100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"262\" data-imgfileid=\"506169427\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_638fa4c.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">为什么会这样？</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">我们让AI解释背后的原理，其实就是一个</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">中学物理概念：力矩。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">比如推门，同样是用力，推在门把手上，门很容易打开；靠近门轴的位置，使同样的劲，门就没那么容易动。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"A greater force is required to push open a door next to the hinges than at the door handle\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.790650406504065\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"492\" data-imgfileid=\"506169441\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_8bce8f3.png\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">人单腿站立也有类似的道理。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">所以我们三次演示里，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">手表从头到尾就是个道具</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">而且，AI帮我们分析这类演示时，还有一个特别值得注意的问题：</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">实验条件根本没有得到严格控制。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第一次体验者没防备，第二次知道有人要推自己了，会</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">下意识绷紧肌肉、调整姿势</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。再加上</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">施力大小、位置都很难完全一致</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，这样的现场演示，能有多大的说服力？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">再回头看看这款戒指宣传的原理。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.5918686473807662\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1279\" style=\"width:100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"920\" data-imgfileid=\"506169454\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_823b64e.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">什么复合微磁新材料、前庭感知系统、优化神经传导，听起来特别高科技。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">可把这些专业名词交给AI逐个拆解，真正需要回答的问题其实很简单。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">人体保持平衡，确实依靠内耳前庭、视觉、本体感觉和肌肉等多个系统共同配合。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">但一枚戴在手指上的戒指，到底是怎么影响这套系统的？能改善多少？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.9073359073359073\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1036\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169463\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_d5945bc.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">一堆听起来高深的科学名词，加上一场漏洞百出的推人演示，就敢说一枚2299元的戒指能防摔？</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">这也是我觉得AI特别有价值的地方。过去遇到这种宣传，普通人可能一听那些专业名词就被唬住了。现在</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">直接丢给AI，让它解释原理、找实验漏洞、查科学依据</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">，很多高大上的说法就没那么神秘了。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">十多年前，这笔智商税就有人交过</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">看到这个戒指，我想起</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">十多年前风靡全球的Power Balance能量手环</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">就是一条普通硅胶手环，上面嵌着全息图案，却号称能够改善人的力量、平衡和柔韧性。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"Pulseiras do Equilíbrio: esquema fraudulento de dois irmãos resultou em indenizações milionárias; veja valores\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6634199134199135\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"924\" data-imgfileid=\"506169425\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_3c9c29c.jpeg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">当年的销售演示，跟今天几乎一模一样：先让人单腿站立、展开手臂，一推就倒。然后拿着手环再试一次，突然就站稳了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6660746003552398\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"563\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169446\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_647ca32.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">十多年过去，连演示方式都没变。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这东西当年火得不得了，NBA球星奥尼尔都为它站台，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">2010年预计销售额超过3500万美元</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">可惜那时候还没有AI</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，不然随手问两句，这套把戏都坑不了这么多钱。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"Shaquille O'Neal of the Cleveland Cavaliers\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"460\" style=\"width:100%;\" data-backw=\"460\" data-backh=\"276\" data-imgfileid=\"506169426\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_70ca561.jpeg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">后来，研究人员找来42名运动员，做了一次随机双盲测试。一半人先戴真手环，一半人先戴普通手环，第二轮再交换，连测试人员都不知道谁戴的是真的。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">结果特别有意思：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">真手环和假手环没什么差别，但不管第二轮戴的是哪个，大家的表现都变好了。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5392405063291139\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"790\" style=\"width: 100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"312\" data-imgfileid=\"506169449\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_8b1b032.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5325\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"800\" style=\"width: 100%;\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"308\" data-imgfileid=\"506169448\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_c017a14.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">原因可能很简单，第二次已经熟悉了动作，身体做好了准备，再加上热身等因素，表现自然可能更好。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">后来Power Balance澳大利亚公司自己也承认，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">此前宣传的功效没有任何科学依据</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，还同意</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">修改广告、向符合条件的消费者退款</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">当年叫全息手环，现在叫微磁戒指。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">熟悉的配方，熟悉的味道。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6259259259259259\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169453\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_6bc5f45.png\"></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">2299元买健康，还是交智商税？</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">一枚3.5克的戒指，卖2299元。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">它瞄准的是老年人最担心的事情：走路摔倒、晚上睡不好。子女愿意为父母健康花钱，如果真有用，2299元可能还真不算贵。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5899893503727369\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1878\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169450\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170313_9d74c05.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">而它的营销也挺有一套。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">先用复合微磁材料、前庭感知系统等专业名词</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">制造科技感</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，再让你</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">现场试一试</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，亲眼看到戴上戒指后站得更稳。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"b2\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.48359375\" data-type=\"webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-imgfileid=\"506169443\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_ffcc6b8.jpeg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">最厉害的是，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">让你以为自己已经亲身验证过了。别人说的可能是假的，我自己试出来的，总该是真的吧？</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">可你感受到的变化可能是真的，造成变化的原因却未必是戒指。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这时候再告诉你，它还能帮助老人防跌倒、辅助改善睡眠，2299元似乎就没那么贵了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.662962962962963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"506169455\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261105170312_0e07a5f.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">可如果买到的只是一个</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">功效未经可靠验</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">证的戒指，这钱</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">跟</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">交智商税有什么区别？</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">现在有AI了，以后老人再看上什么神奇保健品、养生神器，不妨先拍张照发给AI，问问这东西到底值不值得买，有没有可靠的效果证据。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;至少在掏钱之前，能多听一个不靠卖货赚钱的分析，重要信息再核实一下。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">白花钱已经够冤了，更怕老人信了所谓的防摔神器，放松真正必要的防护。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">让AI帮老人多把一道关，少交点健康智商税。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">多问AI少交智商税</span></span></h2>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">其实这种江湖骗术，几十年前就有了。换个包装，起几个高科技名字，再设计一套唬人的演示，就能反复收割消费者。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">现在不一样了。每个人口袋里，都能装一个随时可以请教的AI科学顾问。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">以后再看到什么神奇黑科技，别急着掏钱。先让AI解释原理、查查论文、找找漏洞。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">江湖骗术层出不穷，但有了AI，咱们普通人也该少交点智商税了。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">也欢迎大家</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: bold;\">转发</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">给家人朋友，尤其是家里的老人，少被这些套路忽悠。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);\">关注</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">老傅，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">一起用AI看懂新世界</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">，少踩坑，多受益！</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "文章通过 AI 分析 2299 元防摔戒指的科学原理，揭示其实际是利用力矩原理制造错觉，提醒读者理性消费，避免智商税。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "文章通过 AI 分析 2299 元防摔戒指的科学原理，揭示其实际是利用力矩原理制造错觉，提醒读者理性消费，避免智商税。",
  "summary": "作者选取了一款售价 2299 元的防摔戒指进行打假分析。该产品宣称利用复合微磁材料和前庭感知系统改善平衡能力。作者让 AI 分析其科学原理，并设计实验对比。实验发现，改变施力方向即可产生类似效果，说明戒指本身并无防摔作用。文章进一步回顾了十多年前类似的 Power Balance 能量手环骗局，指出这类产品通过专业术语制造科技感，利用现场演示误导消费者。最后强调，AI 可以帮助普通人识别江湖骗术，理性消费，避免智商税。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "AI 揭示防摔戒指的科学原理漏洞",
      "explanation": "通过 AI 分析，作者指出戒指宣称的复合微磁材料和前庭感知系统在实际作用上并无显著防摔效果，所谓的防摔原理无法通过物理学解释。"
    },
    {
      "point": "力矩原理解释演示效果",
      "explanation": "作者通过改变施力方向（从身体外侧偏转为内侧），证明戴戒指或否，站立稳定性主要取决于推力方向与人体支撑方向的相对位置，而非戒指本身的功能。"
    },
    {
      "point": "实验控制条件不严谨削弱说服力",
      "explanation": "第一次演示未防备，第二次受试者会下意识调整姿势，施力大小和位置难以一致，导致现场演示的可信度大打折扣。"
    },
    {
      "point": "AI 助力普通人识别智商税",
      "explanation": "文章强调，AI 可以像科学顾问一样帮助消费者快速分析产品宣称的科学依据，查找实验漏洞，减少盲目消费的风险。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
